T* (Section 7.1 General Specialist Rules:) Tj
T* (Routine out-of-network specialist visits require advance written referral unless waived below.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Section 7.3\(a\) Emergency and After-Hours Urgent Care Waiver:) Tj
T* (No PCP referral or prior authorization is required for Emergency Services or after-hours) Tj
T* (Urgent Care visits between 8:00 PM and 8:00 AM local time, regardless of network status.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Section 7.4\(b\) Direct Access to In-Network OB-GYN and Behavioral Health:) Tj
T* (Members may see any in-network OB-GYN or outpatient behavioral health clinician without a referral.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Section 9.2\(c\) Retroactive Prior Authorization for Urgent Imaging \(21-Day Window\):) Tj
T* (Retroactive prior authorization for MRI/CT/PET imaging is granted if requested within 21 calendar) Tj
T* (days of service AND the ordering physician documents clinical urgency in the chart.) Tj
